<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Air strikes by the Sudanese Armed Forces have hit gold mining sites on the Sudan-Egypt border, killing dozens of miners, while a paramilitary drone strike attributed to the Rapid Support Forces killed several people near the Ethiopian frontier. Humanitarian officials warn that the attacks are expanding the threat to civilians in West Kordofan and the border triangle region. The conflict has already produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261012-egypt-sudan-border-airstrikes-gold-miners-killed&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168556&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqy43vrk8wv8o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/11/deadly-air-strike-kills-dozens-at-sudan-gold-mine-near-egypt-border?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPQVotOGsxV1lzQ2J4ZVhTRGlhQjhOdEhZSEZKTExPRWk0bF9HaHpmNmQtc0o5RzZlS2RBR1FfU1Z1djg4RWhqYk9wcS1BNnh2SEZXZkpzcTNKV3ZNcWFteTJFYWJTbHhQUnVUS3ZXOVpyZTh6RExFdnFxWU4ybF9RUkVtb1JtY1U0M21QYkZXVFJ1MElpX25RN2lYTlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNUFBfVzRteUl3YWdXNU1yUWFndHZoOHVsSEdxSmZnZDdfeDRNcGdpcjJjel9hZ1pMRVgtVDBQZUVBWGVmNlhFZDNIdkFrdV91aFQyVUxwVDN2MFZSSzlMbVZoYnJHS05PVW1oRVZzcWNOUEphbEtHaWo2Q19lWnE0a1UzVVYzbGdqMldpaFN2TmlEZXBydnl6V3BZR3BPSkU3VThRNEJYcHF6bEIzdTNBczBTelJVUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https